{"articleNo":"121479","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=121479&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[졸업]2015년 2월 졸업사정내역 제공(졸업가능여부 확인메뉴)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.01.23","hit":"5553","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2014학년도 전기(2015년 2월) 졸업사정내역</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">을 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">\"</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #353535; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">졸업가능여부 확인메뉴를 이용\"</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">하여 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">아래와 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">같이 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제공</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">함을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #22741c\" color=\"#ffffff\">* 현재 졸업사정자료 확인 중으로, 졸업사정내역은 변경될 수 있음을 알려드립니다.</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #22741c\" color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">* 졸업식 : 2015.02.13.(금), 세부내역은 추후 공지 예정입니다.</span></font></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">*졸업가능여부 확인메뉴 안에 <strong>졸업가능여부 확인자료 재산출 버튼을 눌러</strong> 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 현재 기준으로 졸업사정결과 및 내역이 재산출 됩니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제공 기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2015.01.23.(금)~02.06.(금) [</span><strong><font size=\"3\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">졸업 확정 시까지]</font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제공 대상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 2014학년도 전기(2015년 2월) 졸업대상자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 3학년 이상 재학생(건축학전공 4학년) : 3월 중 제공(추후 공지 예정)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">제공 자료</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 각 이수구분별 졸업관련 내역</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -147.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 147.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 기본자료 : 주전공</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -147.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 147.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 추가이수자료 : 공학인증, 부전공, 복수전공, 연계전공, 교직과정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #800000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">경로</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : </span></span>원스톱서비스</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #939393; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">〉</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학사관리</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #939393; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">〉</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">졸업</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; COLOR: #939393; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">〉</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">졸업가능여부 확인자료 조회/출력</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 문의사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 공학인증 관련 : 각 학부(과) 행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 공학인증 외 : 교무처 학사관리팀(478-7028)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2015. 01. 23.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교 무 처 장</span></strong></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
